{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>For you shall take seven ewes from my hand.</b> The Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: you gave him seven ewes; by your life, I shall delay the joy of your children for seven generations, and they will destroy seven dwellings of your children: the Tent of Meeting, Gilgal, Shiloh, Nov, Givon, and the Eternal House — two. And He shall delay My ark for seven months in the house of the Philistines in the field, and this is what is stated in Psalms: 'and the enemies have shut it up.' David said: what he gave to Avimelech — for three generations it was given to Avraham for seven generations, for Moshe was seventh to Avraham, and still Pharaoh, grandson of Avimelech, persists."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :register {:flags {0 ["the Eternal"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:14.644249128Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}